#: 5182c83206784606b0829d2c9b6ac781
msgid "Colophon"
msgstr "版权与说明"

#: 9794c4c3d9f94bc59bdf64710311aedc
msgid "Diátaxis is the work of `Daniele Procida <https://vurt.eu>`_."
msgstr "Diátaxis 是 `Daniele Procida <https://vurt.eu>`_ 的作品。"

#: 0663a45da9d54c4d89fbe20cb3199db5
msgid ""
"It has been developed over a number of years, and continues to be elaborated"
" and explored."
msgstr "它历经多年发展，仍在不断完善与探索。"

#: f7426050a54e4175950ae656e6928c66
msgid "Contact me"
msgstr "联系我"

#: 4a1b9d29eb5c4544b008cf5a16336df4
msgid ""
"`Email me <daniele@vurt.org>`_. I enjoy hearing about other people's "
"experiences with Diátaxis and read everything I receive."
msgstr "`给我发邮件 <daniele@vurt.org>`_。我乐于听到他人使用 Diátaxis 的经验，也会阅读收到的每一封来信。"

#: eed8cb139b3e4818b6c39b79522a0688
msgid ""
"I appreciate all the interest and do my best to reply, but I get a "
"considerable quantity of email related to Diátaxis and I can't promise to "
"respond to every message."
msgstr "我感谢大家的关注，并会尽力回复；但与 Diátaxis 有关的邮件数量很多，无法保证逐一答复。"

#: 48900678576346dc8b0e7c23a4342cfe
msgid ""
"If you'd like to discuss Diátaxis with other users, please see the "
"*#diataxis* channel on the `Write the Docs Slack group "
"<https://www.writethedocs.org/slack/>`_, or the `Discussions "
"<https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework/discussions>`_ "
"section of the `GitHub repository for this website "
"<https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework>`_."
msgstr ""
"如果希望与其他用户讨论 Diátaxis，请参阅 `Write the Docs Slack 群组 "
"<https://www.writethedocs.org/slack/>`_ 中的 *#diataxis* 频道，或访问本网站 "
"`GitHub 仓库 <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework>`_ 的 "
"`Discussions <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework/discussions>`_ 区域。"

#: 17b4d989689141a9a8c6ea510693f2d5
msgid "Origins and development"
msgstr "起源与发展"

#: e3363271d77c45768edf10f0ec890bc0
msgid ""
"You can find `an earlier presentation of some of these ideas "
"<https://documentation.divio.com>`_, that I created while working at Divio "
"between 2014-2021. I still agree with most of it, though there are several "
"aspects that I now think I got wrong."
msgstr ""
"你可以找到我在 2014 至 2021 年于 Divio 工作时制作的 `这些想法的早期介绍 "
"<https://documentation.divio.com>`_。其中大部分观点我至今仍认同，不过也有若干方面"
"如今看来当时理解有误。"

#: 4fe05ca99d12458d9083edb81af9c852
msgid ""
"The original context for the Diátaxis approach was limited to software "
"product documentation."
msgstr "Diátaxis 方法最初的语境仅限于软件产品文档。"

#: 44df9e72eb734754af76b48f8f7a84cf
msgid ""
"In 2021 I was awarded a Fellowship of the `Software Sustainability Institute"
" <http://software.ac.uk/blog/sorry-state-usable-software-open-science-"
"results-open-science-retreat>`_, to explore its application in scientific "
"research contexts. More recently I've explored its application in internal "
"corporate documentation, organisational management and education, and also "
"its application at scale. This work is on-going."
msgstr ""
"2021 年，我获得 `软件可持续性研究所 <http://software.ac.uk/blog/sorry-state-usable-software-open-science-"
"results-open-science-retreat>`_ 的研究员资助，以探索其在科研语境中的应用。近来我又"
"探索了它在企业内部文档、组织管理、教育及大规模场景中的应用。这项工作仍在继续。"

#: d0111918e59d41f98987cc7c27302951
msgid ""
"Other people have corresponded with me to share their experience of applying"
" Diátaxis to note-taking systems and even as part of a systematic approach "
"to household management."
msgstr ""
"还有其他人与我通信，分享将 Diátaxis 应用于笔记系统，甚至作为家庭管理系统化方法"
"一部分的经验。"

#: facba52194164cf3b48924bd086040e9
msgid "Citation and contribution"
msgstr "引用与贡献"

#: 99ecc9eee6594cbb9b34d3cee2b6046d
msgid ""
"To cite Diátaxis, please refer to :doc:`this website, diataxis.fr <index>`."
msgstr "如需引用 Diátaxis，请参阅 :doc:`本网站 diataxis.fr <index>`。"

#: 904da8251ff24a5180fcdb0b329f541b
msgid ""
"The Git repository for the source material contains a citation file, "
"`CITATION.cff <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-"
"framework/blob/main/CITATION.cff>`_."
msgstr ""
"源材料的 Git 仓库包含一份引用文件：`CITATION.cff <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-"
"framework/blob/main/CITATION.cff>`_。"

#: e57b29f42a5e4f2d852b580f709aaecd
msgid ""
"APA and BibTeX metadata are available from the *Cite this repository* option"
" at https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework."
msgstr ""
"可通过 https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework 的 *Cite this repository* "
"选项获取 APA 和 BibTeX 元数据。"

#: e660262e1b8c4245b752c7130de137dd
msgid ""
"You can also submit a pull request to suggest an improvement or correction, "
"or `file an issue <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-"
"framework/issues>`_."
msgstr ""
"你也可以提交拉取请求以建议改进或修正，或 `提交 issue <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-"
"framework/issues>`_。"

#: 486034caa7234955836d1e9d34392fd4
msgid ""
"Diátaxis is now used in several hundred projects and it is no longer "
"possible for me to keep up with requests to have projects listed here as "
"examples of Diátaxis adoption."
msgstr ""
"Diátaxis 现已用于数百个项目，因此我已无法继续处理将项目列为 Diátaxis 采用示例的请求。"

#: c78ea5a0f3c6418d8cf9426330f9c97c
msgid "Website"
msgstr "网站"

#: 3cd7a7716568460cb810b3cc25421401
msgid ""
"This website is built with `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org>`_ and hosted"
" on `Read the Docs <http://readthedocs.org>`_, using a modified version of "
"`Pradyun Gedam <https://pradyunsg.me/>`_'s `Furo "
"<https://github.com/pradyunsg/furo>`_ theme."
msgstr ""
"本网站使用 `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org>`_ 构建，托管在 `Read the Docs "
"<http://readthedocs.org>`_，使用的是 `Pradyun Gedam <https://pradyunsg.me/>`_ 的 "
"`Furo <https://github.com/pradyunsg/furo>`_ 主题的修改版。"
